(1)  247/    1610 :                     ; ====================================================================
(1)  248/    1610 :                     ; --------------------------------------------------------
(1)  249/    1610 :                     ; System_Render
(1)  250/    1610 :                     ;
(1)  251/    1610 :                     ; This will:
(1)  252/    1610 :                     ; - Drop a frame if we got late on VBlank
(1)  253/    1610 :                     ; - Process Palette fading buffers
(1)  254/    1610 :                     ;   (Video_MdMars_RunFade: CPU-INTENSIVE IF PROCESSING
(1)  255/    1610 :                     ;   BOTH VDP AND 32X SVDP Palettes)
(1)  256/    1610 :                     ; - Check the sound driver for any changes/requests
(1)  257/    1610 :                     ;   from Z80 (Sound_Update, several times)
(1)  258/    1610 :                     ; - 32X/CD32X only: Update the "DREQ RAM" section
(1)  259/    1610 :                     ;   to the SH2 using DREQ FIFO (System_MdMars_Update)
(1)  260/    1610 :                     ;
(1)  261/    1610 :                     ; Then during VBlank:
